# Release-please generated changelog (see BSOD-269 for the trade-off).
# release-please emits `*` bullets and a double blank line after each
# version heading, which Prettier (default markdown config) always
# rewrites to `-` / single blank line. The first CI run on a release-please
# PR would otherwise fail the `format-check` job. We accept that Prettier
# no longer enforces style on this file in exchange for the release-please
# workflow producing a green PR without a manual follow-up commit.
CHANGELOG.md

